  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">0.&#160;</span><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">바이브코딩으로 앱 만드실때 <br>아이디어가 필요합니다<br></span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">아이디어를 공유해봅니다.</span></b><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxI41rGSMMl9w9sIduKD_uX2FztoC-JXy4UGyFGthCGUOL184tUGF3nTOMrnbiaoi_s7w/exec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxI41rGSMMl9w9sIduKD_uX2FztoC-JXy4UGyFGthCGUOL184tUGF3nTOMrnbiaoi_s7w/exec</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"문항 생성 및 풀이 앱\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"script.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxI41rGSMMl9w9sIduKD_uX2FztoC-JXy4UGyFGthCGUOL184tUGF3nTOMrnbiaoi_s7w/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxI41rGSMMl9w9sIduKD_uX2FztoC-JXy4UGyFGthCGUOL184tUGF3nTOMrnbiaoi_s7w/exec\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxI41rGSMMl9w9sIduKD_uX2FztoC-JXy4UGyFGthCGUOL184tUGF3nTOMrnbiaoi_s7w/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxI41rGSMMl9w9sIduKD_uX2FztoC-JXy4UGyFGthCGUOL184tUGF3nTOMrnbiaoi_s7w/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">문항 생성 및 풀이 앱</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">script.google.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">위 링크 클릭해보시면 제가 만든 앱을 확인하실 수 있습니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">학생들이 각자 문항을 내고,&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">각자 같은반 학생들이 낸 문항을 풀어보는</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(문항 출제하고, 같은반 친구들이 낸 문항 풀어보는) </span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">앱 입니다</span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"문항 생성 및 풀이 앱\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"script.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxI41rGSMMl9w9sIduKD_uX2FztoC-JXy4UGyFGthCGUOL184tUGF3nTOMrnbiaoi_s7w/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxI41rGSMMl9w9sIduKD_uX2FztoC-JXy4UGyFGthCGUOL184tUGF3nTOMrnbiaoi_s7w/exec\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxI41rGSMMl9w9sIduKD_uX2FztoC-JXy4UGyFGthCGUOL184tUGF3nTOMrnbiaoi_s7w/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxI41rGSMMl9w9sIduKD_uX2FztoC-JXy4UGyFGthCGUOL184tUGF3nTOMrnbiaoi_s7w/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">문항 생성 및 풀이 앱</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">script.google.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5864e4aa50c6cc296f0b38c75d547c0fe37f0a2d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5864e4aa50c6cc296f0b38c75d547c0fe37f0a2d\" data-origin-width=\"204\" data-origin-height=\"668\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">위 명단(10반, 번호, 유명인 이름)으로 들어가서 해보시는 방법</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/42f7e8da9292bf4c06dd22cb56d13a4a16a69735\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/42f7e8da9292bf4c06dd22cb56d13a4a16a69735\" data-origin-width=\"946\" data-origin-height=\"555\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">반 : 10반</span><br><span style=\"color: #333333;\">(1~9반은 저희학교 실제 학생들 용)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">번호: 위에 보이는 19~26번 사이의 번호와 이름(위 유명인 명단)을 넣고, 시작하기 버튼 누르면</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">로그인이 됩니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(한명으로 로그인하고 문항 출제한 뒤</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">다른 사람으로 로그인 해서 문항 풀어보면,</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">같은반 친구가 출제한 문항을 풀 수 있음을 확인할 수 있습니다.)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3189fad2dddaa49dd8abf53ff7aea818d0b0a0dc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3189fad2dddaa49dd8abf53ff7aea818d0b0a0dc\" data-origin-width=\"1488\" data-origin-height=\"868\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">2.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">새 문항 만들기</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">문항 유형 고르고</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/61e56ca75d1ce4ae5e9932116da57ffe5141a2ec\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/61e56ca75d1ce4ae5e9932116da57ffe5141a2ec\" data-origin-width=\"904\" data-origin-height=\"215\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">문항을 출제하면 됩니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">3.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">문항 출제가 완료되면</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">문항에 오류가 있는지 없는지에 대한 AI피드백 받기 버튼을 누릅니다</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a11a0d5a4e83c3261fc3cfc5dc77a58371a6d35b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a11a0d5a4e83c3261fc3cfc5dc77a58371a6d35b\" data-origin-width=\"1169\" data-origin-height=\"311\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">4.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">피드백을 받고</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">최종 제출 버튼을 누릅니다</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a9f0cbb950f9554ced6d9835fb3c5e3e0863502e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a9f0cbb950f9554ced6d9835fb3c5e3e0863502e\" data-origin-width=\"483\" data-origin-height=\"145\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">5.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">문항 풀이 모드로 전환하기 버튼을 누르면</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/53a3096262c7760e47aed1d98ffb8221d8ba580a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/53a3096262c7760e47aed1d98ffb8221d8ba580a\" data-origin-width=\"929\" data-origin-height=\"564\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">같은반 친구들이 출제한 문항들이 나옵니다.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">문제를 풀고</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">정답 확인 버튼을 누르면</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">문항을 낸 학생이 답이라고 생각한 정답과 AI가 생각하는 답을 알려줍니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">지금까지는 테스트반을 만들어서 사용한 캡쳐사진.</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#160;</span></p><hr data-ke-style=\"style5\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">지금부터는 <br>실제 학생들과 수업시간에 활용했을때<br>학생들이 만든 문제에 제가 접속하여 본....<br></span></b><br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">같은반 학생이 낸 모든 문항을 풀어볼 수 있습니다.</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3a106e84f23127ab8f273049834c12a9c372a386\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3a106e84f23127ab8f273049834c12a9c372a386\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"797\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">위 사진은</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">실제 수업시간에 진행하여 접속하면 나오는 화면</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">같은반 학생 26개 문항이 출제됨.(본인이 출제한 문제 빼고 26개)</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">만약 틀렸으면 아래사진처럼 화면이 나옵니다</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1943e473cf1b580dd1f2076f97ee14922b194047\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1943e473cf1b580dd1f2076f97ee14922b194047\" data-origin-width=\"910\" data-origin-height=\"827\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}